9db7cdaa1e4989202","layer":"original","quote":"会武陵蛮夷蠢动，岱与太常潘濬共讨定之","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":27,"end":45},{"id":"hequan-q-7ec889ad046bbadd1e9b","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-b9ceb362e6ecd228dd14","layer":"original","quote":"庐陵贼李桓、路合，会稽东冶贼随春，南海贼罗厉等，一时并起","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":189,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":7,"end":35},{"id":"hequan-q-908e34165d682ec029f4","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-b9ceb362e6ecd228dd14","layer":"original","quote":"桓、厉等，皆见斩获，传首诣都","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":189,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":80,"end":94},{"id":"houfei-q-b-64a27e8dc3dd5339d73a","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-64a27e8dc3dd5339d73a","layer":"modern","quote":"〖16〗四年：青龙四年（公元 236）。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":114,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-bd98b8bd7ce8c71de9ac","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"houfei-q-o025","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-0744a279ae4c62a54e64","layer":"original","quote":"青龙二年春，追谥后兄俨曰安城乡穆侯。夏，吴贼寇扬州，以像为伏波将军〖12〗，持节，监诸将东征〖13〗。还，复为射声校尉〖14〗。三年薨〖15〗，追赠卫将军，改封魏昌县，谥曰贞侯。子畅嗣。又封畅弟温、4 、艳，皆为列侯。四年〖16〗，改逸、俨本封，皆曰魏昌侯，谥因故〖17〗。封俨世妇刘为东乡君〖18〗，又追封逸世妇张为安喜君。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":97,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":163},{"id":"panlu-q-71cf51b83daa12bc6661","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-d09ac44ce73d7c54ccbc","layer":"original","quote":"五溪蛮夷叛乱盘结，权假濬节，督诸军讨之；信赏必行，法不可干；斩首获生，盖以万数。自是群蛮衰弱，一方宁静","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51},{"id":"panlu-q-db1c8c481beb9a31af7a","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-d09ac44ce73d7c54ccbc","layer":"original","quote":"先是，濬与陆逊俱驻武昌，共掌留事〖11〗。还〖12〗，复故","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":55,"end":84},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o110a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-25c8543a614585a1e1a6","layer":"original","quote":"冬十一月，太常潘濬平武陵蛮夷事毕，还武昌。诏复曲阿为云阳，丹徒为武进〖11〗。庐陵贼李桓、罗厉等为乱〖12〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":49,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o113d-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-56f9d22ba18041334d05","layer":"original","quote":"中郎将吾粲获李桓〖20〗；将军唐咨〖21〗，获罗厉等。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":78,"end":105},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o107","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-adeefad7184b459985c1","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，诏曰：“兵久不辍，民困于役，岁或不登〖2〗。其宽诸逋〖3〗，勿复督课〖4〗。”","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":46,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o110","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-25c8543a614585a1e1a6","layer":"original","quote":"冬十一月，太常潘濬平武陵蛮夷事毕，还武昌。诏复曲阿为云阳，丹徒为武进〖11〗。庐陵贼李桓、罗厉等为乱〖12〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":49,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o113","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-56f9d22ba18041334d05","layer":"original","quote":"五年春〖15〗，铸大钱，一当五百。诏使吏民输铜〖16〗，计铜畀直〖17〗；设盗铸之科〖18〗。（二）〔三〕月，武昌言甘露降于礼宾殿。辅吴将军张昭卒〖19〗。中郎将吾粲获李桓〖20〗；将军唐咨〖21〗，获罗厉等。自十月不雨，至于夏。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":115},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-934abed655148ea08df3","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-934abed655148ea08df3","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗十二年：建兴十二年（公元 234）。以上诸葛亮出兵北伐共计五次，经由祁山只有两次。后世所说的“六出祁山”并非历史真实。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":269,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1e22705f935572994567","start":0,"end":62},{"id":"zhuge-q-o039","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e60db7c722cd4fe4fb69","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春〖2〗，亮悉大众由斜谷出，以流马运；据武功五丈原〖3〗，与司马宣王对于渭南〖4〗。亮每患粮不继，使己志不申；是以分兵屯田，为久驻之基。耕者杂于渭滨居民之间，而百姓安堵〖5〗，军无私焉〖6〗。﹝三﹞相持百余日。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":108}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
